{
  "description": "備註驗證的共用案例（SRS §5.1、D-09、D-15、D-28）。expected 為 OK 或錯誤代碼；normalized 為去頭尾空白後的值；codePoints 為 Unicode code point 數。D-28：只要含換行或控制字元（Unicode Cc、Zl、Zp 類別）就是 INVALID_REQUEST，不論位置；去頭尾空白只去掉一般空白字元（Unicode Zs 類別，含全形空白與 U+00A0），U+FEFF 等格式字元（Cf）不算空白。",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "空字串",
      "input": "",
      "expected": "OK",
      "normalized": "",
      "codePoints": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "去頭尾半形空白",
      "input": "  abc  ",
      "expected": "OK",
      "normalized": "abc",
      "codePoints": 3
    },
    {
      "name": "去頭尾全形空白",
      "input": "　abc　",
      "expected": "OK",
      "normalized": "abc",
      "codePoints": 3
    },
    {
      "name": "剛好 100 字",
      "input": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa",
      "expected": "OK",
      "normalized": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa",
      "codePoints": 100
    },
    {
      "name": "101 字",
      "input": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa",
      "expected": "NOTE_TOO_LONG"
    },
    {
      "name": "去空白後剛好 100 字",
      "input": " aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa ",
      "expected": "OK",
      "normalized": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa",
      "codePoints": 100
    },
